flowchart LR
    Client[Mail client] -->|IMAP / POP3 / ManageSieve| Director[nauthilus-director]
    MTA[SMTP MTA] -->|LMTP| Director
    Director -->|TLS + trusted PROXY| Server[mail server replicas]
    Director --> Auth[Nauthilus]
    Server -->|authentication / lookup| Auth
    Server -->|librados| Ceph[(Ceph RADOS)]
    Server -->|redirect / vacation / notify| Relay[SMTP relay]
    Server -->|allowlisted program| Learning[learning target / Rspamd]
    Server -->|logs / metrics / traces| Observability[monitoring]
